msgctxt "92"
msgid "...All right, Kazuki-san. But I do hope you consider a second club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "It's not gonna happen. My mind is made up on this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Heh... No need to be so stubborn. I'll be back later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Not much. But who was he? Has one of the \"families\" been paying you a "
"visit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"No, that was Kyogoku-san. He's a businessman in charge of all kinds of host "
"and hostess venues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"And lately, he's been trying to get us to open up another branch of "
"Stardust..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "A second club, huh? That sure would be something..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Indeed... The Stardust name has really taken off, so he wants us to expand "
"to another region."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "And where was he thinking that would be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Yokohama. He thinks it would be a good way to avoid the tight competition in"
" Tokyo and plant some new roots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Kyogoku-san's group doesn't have a club with any star power in Yokohama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"That's why he's offering me capital to really promote the Stardust name "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"But I have absolutely no desire for a second club. What I have here is more "
"than enough."
msgstr ""

